{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793332117.073699, "run_id": "bdc067d97c8048438cea4b7d3dc0e807", "seq": 120, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "第9页 Table 1 将 Self Consistency 的推理技术概括为 Ensemble，将 Tree of Thoughts 概括为 depth-first-search prompts，二者都用于数学题或 Game of 24 等基准。这是初步线索，尚不能确定 Self Consistency 最终如何从多条路径中选答案，也不能确定 ToT 的两种搜索控制器；需继续读第10–13页对方法的说明并用原文核实。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97"], "section": "reasoning"}}
