ly says Calculator, Search engine. Need the Toolformer section later (probably around page 20). So hold off.\n\nWrite updated reasoning note preserving prior + majority voting. Then recall page 11,12,13 (already queued). Let me do a recall with next unqueued ids maybe page 11-13 already queued. Just do write_note and recall next batch ids page 11,12,13 to ensure.\n\nActually recall args should be new ids. Use ev-0aaa..., ev-5ee4..., ev-4049.... They were queued already; recall again is fine but \"do not reread unchanged\". Let's do write_note plus recall page 11-13."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8043, "completion_tokens": 592, "total_tokens": 8635, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 326}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3819}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
