593a30e2846f8394'],\n    content='第10页：Self Consistency 是 ensemble 方法，采样多条不同推理路径，逐一评估，再用 majority voting 选出最一致的答案，通常让 CoT 提升10–20个百分点。答案 self_consistency_selection=majority_voting（精确原文待 page 10 复核）。第13页明确 Tree of Thoughts 的外部控制算法沿推理步骤树搜索、回退并尝试替代路径，原文：\"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" 答案 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。引用（p.13）：\"Here, an external control algorithm is created, that calls the model, each time with a different prompt, so that it follows a tree of reasoning steps. When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"'\n)\nprint(r)\nrecall(['ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3','ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa','ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d','ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248'])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 658}\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:10'}, {'id': 'ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:14'}, {'id': 'ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:15'}, {'id': 'ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:16'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:14'}, {'id': 'ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:15'}, {'id': 'ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:16'}, {'id': 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:17'}, {'id': 'ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:18'}, {'id': 'ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:19'}, {'id': 'ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:20'}, {'id': 'ev-e5b9499e130a976eefe2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:21'}], 'requested_count': 4, 'queued_count': 40, 'message':