{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793332141.4353337, "run_id": "bdc067d97c8048438cea4b7d3dc0e807", "seq": 196, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "Self Consistency (p.10)：ensemble 方法，采样多条不同推理路径、评估后用 majority voting 选出最一致答案，常使 CoT 提升 10–20 个百分点。答案 self_consistency_selection=majority_voting。原文：\"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\" Tree of Thoughts (p.13)：外部控制算法用不同提示反复调用模型沿推理步骤树搜索，路径走完后回溯并尝试替代路径；论文介绍 breadth-first 与 depth-first 两种控制器。答案 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。原文：\"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" 补充（p.15–20）：Reflexion 用 actor/evaluator/reflector 三个提示自我改进；外部控制算法需外部记忆保存树分支与评估状态；DeepSeek-R1 用 GRPO 与 RLVR 通过强化学习自发涌现反思与探索。第20页小结：本部分推理方法主要面向决策而非真实行动；自我反思改进提示、减少幻觉；检索增强与工具让推理 LLM 能用最新信息并检查错误，是通向 acting 的桥梁；提示学习不改参数，要利用推理期生成的数据需 finetuning。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc", "ev-e5b9499e130a976eefe2", "ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b"], "section": "reasoning"}}
