h [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\" — that supports both.\n\nAnswers: toolformer_tools=[calculator, question_answering, search_engine, machine_translation, calendar]; toolbench_api_count=16464.\n\nWrite note tool_use.\n\nThen next batch continues."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9170, "completion_tokens": 619, "total_tokens": 9789, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 164}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4946}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
