{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793332145.2729073, "run_id": "bdc067d97c8048438cea4b7d3dc0e807", "seq": 207, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "tool_use", "content": "行动与工具（p.23）：LLM 可调用外部工具 API，Toolformer [Schick et al., 2023] 自训练决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数、如何把结果并入后续预测。五种工具原文：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar. Further works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\" 答案 toolformer_tools=[calculator, question_answering, search_engine, machine_translation, calendar]；toolbench_api_count=16464。延伸（p.23–25）：EasyTool 基于工具文档做统一结构化指令；ToolAlpaca 有 400 个 API 的 3938 个实例；Gorilla 生成 API 调用并引入 APIBench；planner/caller/summarizer 用不同 LLM 分工（Fig.13）配 ReAct、DFSDT。p.24：OmniParser V2 解析屏幕 GUI 元素；MCP/ACP/ANP 等 agent 互操作协议；Computer Use、Operator、Browser Use 把桌面/浏览器动作包成可调用工具 API。p.24–25 安全：AgentHarm 含 110 个恶意任务，简单通用模板即可越狱 agent；Rainbow Teaming 用 MAP-Elites 质量-多样性生成对抗提示。Table 2（p.10）亦列 Toolformer 的 Reasoning 技术为 call APIs、Acting 为 tool calling。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62", "ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1"], "section": "tool_use"}}
