udy with 100 human evaluators, Generative Agents were rated as more believable...\" I need exact quote.\n\nWe should create a multi_agent note with partial confirmed findings and placeholders? Note should contain answers and quotes eventually. We should wait until page 41-52 delivered. Maybe the next batch will include p.41-43 and then 44-46 etc. Use write_note now with partial multi-agent findings from pages 38-39, preserving details. This is a successful action and triggers next batch.\n\nLet's write multi_agent note title \"multi_agent\" with content around 600 chars including confirmed: ChatEval debate, AgentVerse four stages, Generative Agents 25 agents, AgentSociety 10,000. But must include eventual answers; can update later. Requirement says each final note must contain two answers, page numbers and quotes. We'll update later. We need evidence ids: ev-2f8846... p38, ev-76027... p39, ev-2bcb... p40. Use these. Also if we know CAMEL inception from p.37, no evidence id currently. We can mention \"待补\" but note should not claim. Better write partial. Ensure content occurs verbatim in our response prose and code. We must include the complete exact content in prose before code. Good.\n\nBut final note ≤1500. We'll write ~500.\n\nLet's do write_note with section multi_agent. Evidence ids from delivered."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8904, "completion_tokens": 1204, "total_tokens": 10108, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 938}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4680}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
