e 4, p.51）列五个议题：Training Data（用推理期数据微调、稳定RL、VLA/多模态）、Hallucination（自验证、机制可解释性、开放世界模型）、Agent Behavior（可扩展仿真、角色扮演、蒸馏到小模型）、Self reflection（模型内自反思与元推理、元认知）、Safety（责任与法律、隐私公平、更广应用）。答案 agenda_topics=[training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。p.52 结论：机器人、医疗、金融等已见泛化；三类能力互补，reasoning 是基础，acting/interacting 反哺训练数据；\"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\"，故 shared_foundations=[reasoning, self_verification]。推理范式还连到 System 1/2 与超级智能讨论；多智能体研究自利/利他、竞争/合作、信任等涌现行为。\"\n\nLength check ~ under 1500. Fine.\n\nThen read_pdf(4,5).\n\nLet me count characters roughly — fine.\n\nI'll do both in one block."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8314, "completion_tokens": 2044, "total_tokens": 10358, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1736}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4090}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
