ng keywords plus the following 2 lines.\n\nActually exact quotes matter. Safer to print full relevant paragraphs. Let me print full text of pages 4,5,10,13 (4 pages ~12k chars) — a lot. Hmm.\n\nCompromise: print full text of pages 4, 5 (need categories + search methods), page 10 (self consistency), page 13 (ToT), page 23 (Toolformer/ToolBench), page 45 (CAMEL), page 47 (Generative agents), page 52 (conclusion). That's 8 pages, maybe 25k chars. Too much but manageable? Risky for budget.\n\nUse keyword filter with window: for each page, find lines with keywords and print ±2 lines.\n\nLet me craft keywords per page.\n\nI'll do it."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8158, "completion_tokens": 2517, "total_tokens": 10675, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2052}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3806}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
