{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793332388.6031165, "run_id": "bdc067d97c8048438cea4b7d3dc0e807", "seq": 648, "tool": "write_file", "arguments": {"path": "report.json", "content": "{\n  \"overview\": \"本文综述 agentic LLM，即能推理、行动并与环境交互的大语言模型。作者把能力分为 reasoning、acting、interacting 三类，分别对应符号 AI、机器人/自治系统与连接主义/多智能体三大传统；文献先用 Google Scholar 检索，再用 snowballing 扩展。正文按推理（CoT、自洽、思维树、自我反思与强化学习）、行动（工具调用、具身与 GUI 操作、安全）、交互（多智能体协作与社会模拟）组织，并以研究议程与三类能力互补的结论收尾。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"overview\",\n      \"summary\": \"论文把 agent 能力分为 reasoning、acting、interacting 三类，层层递进：推理为决策提供基础，行动把决策落到工具与环境，交互则涉及多个 agent 及人类社会。分类与传统符号 AI、机器人/自治系统、连接主义/多智能体研究相对应。文献选取先用 Google Scholar 检索，再以 snowballing 补充被引但未收录的工作，只保留基于 LLM 的方法，少量非 agentic 的 LLM 工作仅作背景。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已实现分批 read_pdf 取证、证据 id 版本化与笔记归并；不足是笔记依赖人工挑选页段，缺少自动的相关性排序；未来可加入 snowballing 式的引文扩展检索与更细的批次预算调度。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"categories\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"acting\",\n          \"interacting\"\n        ],\n        \"search_methods\": [\n          \"google_scholar\",\n          \"snowballing\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"categories\",\n          \"page\": 5,\n          \"quote\": \"The categories also correspond to fields in artificial intelligence that have a long research tradition across symbolic AI, robotics/autonomous systems, and connectionism/multi-agent modeling, respectively.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"search_methods\",\n          \"page\": 5,\n          \"quote\": \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reasoning\",\n      \"summary\": \"推理部分从提示工程到结构化搜索：Chain of Thought 让模型逐步推理，Self Consistency 采样多条推理路径并通过多数投票选出最一致的答案，Tree of Thoughts 用外部控制算法调用模型遍历推理步骤树，路径走完后回溯尝试备选路径，论文给出广度优先与深度优先两种控制器。自我反思方向借 actor/evaluator/reflector 提示迭代改进，外部搜索生成的数据还可用于微调，把搜索能力内化到模型。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单条生成路径，没有自洽投票；可对关键抽取任务采样多条路径并用多数投票定稿，也可为证据比对加一层外部树搜索式的回溯重试。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"self_consistency_selection\": \"majority_voting\",\n        \"tot_search\": [\n          \"breadth_first\",\n          \"depth_first\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"self_consistency_selection\",\n          \"page\": 10,\n          \"quote\": \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"tot_search\",\n          \"page\": 13,\n          \"quote\": \"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"行动主题围绕工具调用与具身操作。Toolformer 自训练决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数并把结果并入预测；ToolBench 以大规模 REST API 数据集支撑规划与调用分离的框架（planner/caller/summarizer）。进一步工作涉及工具文档检索、屏幕 GUI 解析、agent 互操作协议，以及提示注入等安全问题，强调要把安全约束嵌入推理与规划流程。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已把 read_pdf.py、pytest 等封装成命令行工具，由模型决定何时调用；不足是没有工具文档检索与调用结果校验；未来可加工具说明检索、参数自检与失败重试。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"toolformer_tools\": [\n          \"calculator\",\n          \"question_answering\",\n          \"search_engine\",\n          \"translation\",\n          \"calendar\"\n        ],\n        \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"toolformer_tools\",\n          \"page\": 23,\n          \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\",\n          \"page\": 23,\n          \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"多智能体部分比较协作与模拟两条路线：ChatEval 用多角色辩论改进评估，AutoGen 以对话为编程范式，AgentVerse 分招募、协作决策、执行与评估四阶段；CAMEL 用 inception prompting 让角色保持身份并合作。Generative Agents 在小镇中模拟 25 个 agent，具备记忆、反思与计划，其可信度由人类评估者排序打分。后续工作用大规模访谈数据构建 agent 复现人类态度。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 是单智能体加工具循环，尚无角色分工与辩论评估；可引入批评者角色对引文与页码做交叉核查，或让多个角色并行抽取再表决。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"camel_prompting\",\n          \"page\": 45,\n          \"quote\": \"CAMEL uses inception prompting to guide the agents to maintain their roles and cooperate.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\",\n          \"page\": 47,\n          \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"Table 4 给出五个研究议题：训练数据、幻觉、agent 行为、自我反思与安全，每项列出具体挑战，如用推理期数据微调、稳定强化学习、自我验证、可扩展仿真与责任归属。结论指出三类能力互补：推理是基础，行动与交互产生的数据反哺训练；安全需要多层防护与标准化基准，应用领域目前仍较窄。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已保留请求、命令与笔记记录，具备可追溯性；不足是缺少安全约束与幻觉自检；未来可加自验证步骤（引文回查页码）与失败重试预算控制。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\n          \"training_data\",\n          \"hallucination\",\n          \"agent_behavior\",\n          \"self_reflection\",\n          \"safety\"\n        ],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"self_verification\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"agenda_topics\",\n          \"page\": 51,\n          \"quote\": \"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"shared_foundations\",\n          \"page\": 52,\n          \"quote\": \"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "expected_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356"}}
{"event": "file_write", "time": 1793332388.6191595, "run_id": "bdc067d97c8048438cea4b7d3dc0e807", "seq": 649, "path": "report.json", "content": "{\n  \"overview\": \"本文综述 agentic LLM，即能推理、行动并与环境交互的大语言模型。作者把能力分为 reasoning、acting、interacting 三类，分别对应符号 AI、机器人/自治系统与连接主义/多智能体三大传统；文献先用 Google Scholar 检索，再用 snowballing 扩展。正文按推理（CoT、自洽、思维树、自我反思与强化学习）、行动（工具调用、具身与 GUI 操作、安全）、交互（多智能体协作与社会模拟）组织，并以研究议程与三类能力互补的结论收尾。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"overview\",\n      \"summary\": \"论文把 agent 能力分为 reasoning、acting、interacting 三类，层层递进：推理为决策提供基础，行动把决策落到工具与环境，交互则涉及多个 agent 及人类社会。分类与传统符号 AI、机器人/自治系统、连接主义/多智能体研究相对应。文献选取先用 Google Scholar 检索，再以 snowballing 补充被引但未收录的工作，只保留基于 LLM 的方法，少量非 agentic 的 LLM 工作仅作背景。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已实现分批 read_pdf 取证、证据 id 版本化与笔记归并；不足是笔记依赖人工挑选页段，缺少自动的相关性排序；未来可加入 snowballing 式的引文扩展检索与更细的批次预算调度。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"categories\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"acting\",\n          \"interacting\"\n        ],\n        \"search_methods\": [\n          \"google_scholar\",\n          \"snowballing\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"categories\",\n          \"page\": 5,\n          \"quote\": \"The categories also correspond to fields in artificial intelligence that have a long research tradition across symbolic AI, robotics/autonomous systems, and connectionism/multi-agent modeling, respectively.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"search_methods\",\n          \"page\": 5,\n          \"quote\": \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reasoning\",\n      \"summary\": \"推理部分从提示工程到结构化搜索：Chain of Thought 让模型逐步推理，Self Consistency 采样多条推理路径并通过多数投票选出最一致的答案，Tree of Thoughts 用外部控制算法调用模型遍历推理步骤树，路径走完后回溯尝试备选路径，论文给出广度优先与深度优先两种控制器。自我反思方向借 actor/evaluator/reflector 提示迭代改进，外部搜索生成的数据还可用于微调，把搜索能力内化到模型。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单条生成路径，没有自洽投票；可对关键抽取任务采样多条路径并用多数投票定稿，也可为证据比对加一层外部树搜索式的回溯重试。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"self_consistency_selection\": \"majority_voting\",\n        \"tot_search\": [\n          \"breadth_first\",\n          \"depth_first\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"self_consistency_selection\",\n          \"page\": 10,\n          \"quote\": \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"tot_search\",\n          \"page\": 13,\n          \"quote\": \"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"行动主题围绕工具调用与具身操作。Toolformer 自训练决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数并把结果并入预测；ToolBench 以大规模 REST API 数据集支撑规划与调用分离的框架（planner/caller/summarizer）。进一步工作涉及工具文档检索、屏幕 GUI 解析、agent 互操作协议，以及提示注入等安全问题，强调要把安全约束嵌入推理与规划流程。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已把 read_pdf.py、pytest 等封装成命令行工具，由模型决定何时调用；不足是没有工具文档检索与调用结果校验；未来可加工具说明检索、参数自检与失败重试。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"toolformer_tools\": [\n          \"calculator\",\n          \"question_answering\",\n          \"search_engine\",\n          \"translation\",\n          \"calendar\"\n        ],\n        \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"toolformer_tools\",\n          \"page\": 23,\n          \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\",\n          \"page\": 23,\n          \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"多智能体部分比较协作与模拟两条路线：ChatEval 用多角色辩论改进评估，AutoGen 以对话为编程范式，AgentVerse 分招募、协作决策、执行与评估四阶段；CAMEL 用 inception prompting 让角色保持身份并合作。Generative Agents 在小镇中模拟 25 个 agent，具备记忆、反思与计划，其可信度由人类评估者排序打分。后续工作用大规模访谈数据构建 agent 复现人类态度。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 是单智能体加工具循环，尚无角色分工与辩论评估；可引入批评者角色对引文与页码做交叉核查，或让多个角色并行抽取再表决。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"camel_prompting\",\n          \"page\": 45,\n          \"quote\": \"CAMEL uses inception prompting to guide the agents to maintain their roles and cooperate.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\",\n          \"page\": 47,\n          \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"Table 4 给出五个研究议题：训练数据、幻觉、agent 行为、自我反思与安全，每项列出具体挑战，如用推理期数据微调、稳定强化学习、自我验证、可扩展仿真与责任归属。结论指出三类能力互补：推理是基础，行动与交互产生的数据反哺训练；安全需要多层防护与标准化基准，应用领域目前仍较窄。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已保留请求、命令与笔记记录，具备可追溯性；不足是缺少安全约束与幻觉自检；未来可加自验证步骤（引文回查页码）与失败重试预算控制。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\n          \"training_data\",\n          \"hallucination\",\n          \"agent_behavior\",\n          \"self_reflection\",\n          \"safety\"\n        ],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"self_verification\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"agenda_topics\",\n          \"page\": 51,\n          \"quote\": \"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"shared_foundations\",\n          \"page\": 52,\n          \"quote\": \"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "before_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356", "file_hash": "2227e2f62bb10bfb03f6ad5fdeb03e2cfb0abae0dc239b72f51aa309f6ddd779", "changed": true}
