adth_first\", \"depth_first\"]},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"self_consistency_selection\", \"page\": 10, \"quote\": \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"tot_search\", \"page\": 13, \"quote\": \"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"行动主题围绕工具调用与具身操作。Toolformer 自训练决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数并把结果并入预测；ToolBench 以大规模 REST API 数据集支撑规划与调用分离的框架（planner/caller/summarizer）。进一步工作涉及工具文档检索、屏幕 GUI 解析、agent 互操作协议，以及提示注入等安全问题，强调要把安全约束嵌入推理与规划流程。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已把 read_pdf.py、pytest 等封装成命令行工具，由模型决定何时调用；不足是没有工具文档检索与调用结果校验；未来可加工具说明检索、参数自检与失败重试。\",\n      \"answers\": {\"toolformer_tools\": [\"calculator\", \"question_answering\", \"search_engine\", \"translation\", \"calendar\"], \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"toolformer_tools\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"多智能体部分比较协作与模拟两条路线：ChatEval 用多角色辩论改进评估，AutoGen 以对话为编程范式，AgentVerse 分招募、协作决策、执行与评估四阶段；CAMEL 用 inception prompting 让角色保持身份并合作。Generative Agents 在小镇中模拟 25 个 agent，具备记忆、反思与计划，其可信度由人类评估者排序打分。后续工作用大规模访谈数据构建 agent 复现人类态度。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 是单智能体加工具循环，尚无角色分工与辩论评估；可引入批评者角色对引文与页码做交叉核查，或让多个角色并行抽取再表决。\",\n      \"answers\": {\"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\", \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"camel_prompting\", \"page\": 45,